travesty - make a travesty of the inputtravesty version 1.1, 12/23/89.Copyright (c) 1989, Daniel J. Bernstein.All rights reserved.This distribution packaged 12/23/89.Files:CHANGES         Description of changes since first distributed versionREADME          This documentMakefile        Installation commandstravesty.c      The programtravesty.man    DocumentationEdit the options in Makefile and type make. travesty will be theexecutable program; travesty.6 will be the nroff'ed documentation.I don't pretend to know your machine's setup so there's no make install.Read CHANGES for a list of changes. Type travesty -C and travesty -Wfor copyright and warranty information, travesty -H for help.